== pgcopydb: e-w1 -> e-w2, PostgreSQL 18 ==

-- latency: 1000 single-row transactions, one session, 50 ms apart
p50 61.7 ms, p95 105.9 ms, p99 112.8 ms, rows 1000

-- throughput: pgbench, 8 clients, 30 s, one insert per transaction
   source: tps = 91574.589189 (without initial connection time)
   source committed 2747545 rows; 1442 were on the target when the load stopped; the rest took 452.3 s more
   target applied 5696 rows/s over the whole run, 48 rows/s while it was loaded

-- one transaction of 1,000,000 rows
   committed on the source after 1.1 s, complete on the target 456.5 s after that
